    "created_at": "2023-04-11T11:56:51Z",
    "updated_at": "2023-04-11T11:56:51Z",
    "body": "> The `as` attribute is defined as taking a https://fetch.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-potential-destination.*\r\n> \r\n> https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#match-preload-type however returns false for a number of destinations.\r\n\r\nOnly if the type attribute is not empty. Any potential destination is OK when there is no type attribute. I think this is a non-issue?\r\n\r\n\r\n",
